    "introduction": {
        "text": "Use this guide to replace a faulty or shattered light bulb in your Conair True Glow Lighted Mirror (model TGBE104XCLED).\nThe light bulb is a piece of hardware that is used to convert electricity into light, consisting of a source of illumination enclosed within a transparent or translucent shell, typically having a rounded shape. For this device, use an all-purpose fluorescent 8W (watt) LED light bulb.\nIf your bulb is shattered, make sure to wear proper clothing and eyewear before beginning this guide.",
        "step_url": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/Conair+True+Glow+Lighted+Mirror+LED+Bulb+Replacement/<#s279648>"
    },
